'how':['The target exists; the team now chooses the actions, resources and route needed to reach it.'],
'action':['The agreed improvement plan is now being carried out.'],
'did':['Actual results are compared with the target to determine whether the improvement achieved what was intended.'],
'momentum':['Learning is embedded, successful changes are reinforced and further improvement 